dataset hyojin0912/GPCRact are part of the GPCRact data and are licensed
under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.


Data provenance
---------------

The GPCRact dataset is derived from public resources including PubChem
BioAssay, ChEMBL (CC BY-SA 3.0), BindingDB, DrugBank (CC BY-NC 4.0) and the
RCSB Protein Data Bank. Users of the data should also respect the terms of
these upstream resources.


Third-party code
----------------

benchmarks/DeepREAL/
  Derived from DeepREAL (https://github.com/XieResearchGroup/DeepREAL),
  Cai T, Abbu KA, Liu Y, Xie L. Bioinformatics 38(9):2561-2570 (2022),
  licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0
  International Licence. Modified by KAIST in November 2025 to retrain the
  model on the GPCRact dataset and scaffold splits: data loading,
  configuration and model files were changed and the training, fingerprint
  and benchmark scripts were added.

benchmarks/AiGPro/
  Derived from AiGPro (https://github.com/Chemoinfomatics/AiGPro),
  Brahma R, Moon S, Shin J-M, Cho K-H. J Cheminform 17 (2025),
  doi:10.1186/s13321-024-00945-7, licensed under the GNU Affero General
  Public License version 3. Modified by KAIST in November 2025: the
  regression output layer was replaced with a three-class classification
  head, the loss was changed to categorical cross-entropy, and data
  preparation, container and benchmark scripts were added or changed. The
  modified files in this directory are distributed under the same licence.

These directories reproduce the baseline comparison reported in the GPCRact
publication and are not required to run GPCRact.


